# a public block's re-export is followed when a use reaches it. Resolving the
# block followed every one, which demanded each subunit it names and walked
# every type in them: a program naming pubtwo.Square alone checked and emitted
# pubtwo.Circle too -- and refused, since Circle's method does not type.
main: function is {
    s: pubtwo.Square side: 3
    print "\{s.area}"
}
